-5a1882245b96" class="r-1d00ye1"><div data-rid="f382bd2f-a06f-42de-8872-50078a25412c" class="r-i4umnw alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-4e9e1fb4-94ca-474b-82ac-38d78f5aef1d-attributes-color:#ffffff"><span style="width:100%"><p>PUMPED!</p></span></div><div data-rid="d5ef932a-5e5e-4030-9819-3262db089589" class="r-pi8d4m alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-4e9e1fb4-94ca-474b-82ac-38d78f5aef1d-attributes-color:#ffffff"><span style="width:100%"><p>Tastes great. Not sweet, so don't expect it to be. Mixes well. I feel freaking GOOD!!</p></span></div><div data-rid="5acbcea6-d80e-4753-b7d8-32a59281c13e" class="r-1d3vs9a alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-4e9e1fb4-94ca-474b-82ac-38d78f5aef1d-attributes-color:#ffffff"><span style="width:100%"><p>Ashton B</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="9ec19127-4423-47f5-9ef8-27067efe6c89" class="r-1pejoiv"><div data-rid="92b8637b-a973-46f8-94a3-44a781f6a87c" class="r-1wuf8xv alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-4e9e1fb4-94ca-474b-82ac-38d78f5aef1d-attributes-color:#ffffff"><span style="width:100%"><p>LOVE THIS STUFF</p></span></div><div data-rid="2f0250ee-861d-46a9-ac00-1d31c80304cc" class="r-qxnmda alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-4e9e1fb4-94ca-474b-82ac-38d78f5aef1d-attributes-color:#ffffff"><span style="width:100%"><p>Really have been enjoying this supplement! One scoop every morning with my orange juice. Helps keep me focused and going all day.</p></span></div><div data-rid="00ca120a-c2ec-44a1-897b-507a18d2b008" class="r-1tyr6d7 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-4e9e1fb4-94ca-474b-82ac-38d78f5aef1d-attributes-color:#ffffff"><span style="width:100%"><p>Jason E</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="f51ba5c5-96b2-4383-80c5-c6fdc047c03b" class="r-1gkulwi"><div data-rid="d8